*  214 - indirect goto :($X) — transfer to a label named by a variable's
*  value (SPITBOL manual, "Indirect Gotos"). Also exercises re-dispatch
*  through a second indirect goto to confirm main labels stay reachable.
        &TRIM = 1
        WHICH = 'ALPHA'
        :($WHICH)
BETA    OUTPUT = 'at BETA'
        NEXT = 'GAMMA'
        :($NEXT)
ALPHA   OUTPUT = 'at ALPHA'
        WHICH = 'BE' 'TA'
        :($WHICH)
GAMMA   OUTPUT = 'at GAMMA'                      :(END)
END
